			"Message": "docs(Maintain): Rebuild CHANGELOG with quarter-based versioning and commit refs\n\nComprehensive CHANGELOG overhaul adding v1.3 (Q4 2025) and v1.0 (Q1-Q2 2025) sections that were missing, expanding existing entries with specific commit hashes and dates, and rewriting the component description to better explain Maintain's role in the build system.\n\nChanges include: added new version sections for gaps in the release history, enriched entries with concrete commit references (e.g., `214ce63`, `f474c38`, `ca7ac56`), expanded the Maintain description from brief to paragraph form explaining its CI/GritQL surface, and aligned all entries to a narrative voice (\"We taught Maintain...\", \"We hardened...\").",
